  "next_id": 71,
  "notes": [
    {
      "at": [
        0,
        -26
      ],
      "id": 70,
      "text": "A ROM as a lookup table, without a microcontroller: a 2 Hz clock steps a 4-bit counter, whose outputs\naddress a 16-byte ROM; each byte holds the segments of a hex digit (bit 0 = a ... bit 6 = g, file\nmemories/hex_digits.hex). Run (F5): the display counts 0-9, A-F. Window > Memory Viewer shows the ROM;\nload another file there to change the symbols."
    }
  ],
